# BFF — Public schedule availability (UC-011, UC-058/059; M23-S29 pinned selections + duration)
# Public — no JWT. Tenant resolved from X-Tenant-Slug.
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run migration:run
#   3. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev
#   4. pnpm --filter @ikaro/bff run dev
#
# REST Client environment: select "local" in VS Code status bar
#
# resourceSelections = <serviceId>:<legIndex or ->:<resourceType>:<resourceId>[,…]

### Availability for one day
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}
X-Tenant-Slug: {{tenantSlug}}

###

### Availability with the customer's chosen resource pinned to a CUSTOMER_CHOICE requirement
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&resourceSelections={{serviceId}}:-:STAFF:{{resourceId}}
X-Tenant-Slug: {{tenantSlug}}

###

### Availability for a CUSTOMER_SELECTED service with its chosen duration
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&durationMinutes=120
X-Tenant-Slug: {{tenantSlug}}

###

### Summary for a date range, with a pinned pick and a chosen duration
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/schedule/availability/summary?from=2026-06-01&to=2026-06-07&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&resourceSelections={{serviceId}}:-:STAFF:{{resourceId}}&durationMinutes=120
X-Tenant-Slug: {{tenantSlug}}

###

### 400 — Missing X-Tenant-Slug
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}

###

### 400 — resourceId and resourceSelections together
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&resourceId={{resourceId}}&resourceSelections={{serviceId}}:-:STAFF:{{resourceId}}
X-Tenant-Slug: {{tenantSlug}}

###

### 400 — malformed resourceSelections item
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&resourceSelections=not-a-selection
X-Tenant-Slug: {{tenantSlug}}

###

### 400 — non-positive durationMinutes
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&durationMinutes=0
X-Tenant-Slug: {{tenantSlug}}

###

### 422 — a pick the service does not allow, or an inactive/out-of-pool/other-tenant resource (BOOKING_SERVICE_RESOURCE_TYPE_UNAVAILABLE)
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&resourceSelections={{serviceId}}:-:ROOM:{{resourceId}}
X-Tenant-Slug: {{tenantSlug}}

###

### 422 — durationMinutes out of range for a CUSTOMER_SELECTED service (BOOKING_DURATION_OUT_OF_RANGE)
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/schedule/availability?date=2026-06-01&serviceIds={{serviceId}}&durationMinutes=9999
X-Tenant-Slug: {{tenantSlug}}
